OL,3,GNEWSARepairs to 19th Century bridge
OL,4,Alikely to cost #40k
OL,5,
OL,6,FTemporary repairs to a 19th Century
OL,7,Fbridge in the Yorkshire Dales which was
OL,8,Fleft damaged after being struck by a
OL,9,Florry are expected to cost #40,000.
OL,11,FThe Grade II listed Middleham Bridge,
OL,12,Fwhich crosses the River Ure near
OL,13,FLeyburn, has been closed since the
OL,14,Fcrash on 3 September.
OL,16,FA specialist contractor had been
OL,17,Fappointed directly to carry out urgent
OL,18,Frepairs, with the cost expected to be
OL,19,Frecovered through an insurance
OL,20,Frecharge, North Yorkshire Council said.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,388,380,200,160,0,100
