OL,3,GNEWSARepairs to 19th Century bridge
OL,4,Alikely to cost #40k
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn the long term, the authority was
OL,7,Fconsidering increasing the height of
OL,8,Fthe arch by approximately 10ins
OL,9,F(250mm), although any alteration would
OL,10,Frequire listed building consent,
OL,11,Fofficers added.
